             ideas and proofs that appeal."; Tito Tonietti -- "Beauty, even in mathematics,
             depends upon historical and cultural contexts, and therefore tends to elude
             numerical interpretation." COMPLICATING find: cite alongside sa2024agree,
             which recovers agreement under a comparative-judgement design. The pair is
             useful precisely because it shows the field is unstable on "do experts agree at all."}
}

